			"Message": "style(Output): replace em-dashes with hyphens in CHANGELOG.md\n\nApply the same typographic normalization to CHANGELOG.md that was performed on source files in the previous commit. Replace all em-dash characters (—) with standard hyphens (-) in version headers and list item descriptions.\n\nThis ensures consistent hyphen usage throughout the Output element documentation, matching the style guideline established for the codebase.",
